
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>College Information Website</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #123c69;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #092746;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 12px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            background-color: #2874a6;
        }

        section {
            background-color: white;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 25px;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #123c69;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2874a6;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        ul {
            margin-left: 25px;
        }

        .course-container,
        .gallery,
        .recruiters {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .course {
            background-color: #eaf2f8;
            padding: 20px;
            width: 220px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .gallery img {
            width: 250px;
            height: 160px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .recruiter {
            background-color: #123c69;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
            min-width: 140px;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #092746;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 18px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav a {
                display: block;
                padding: 8px;
            }

            section {
                width: 95%;
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .course {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .gallery img {
                width: 100%;
                height: auto;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Marwadi University</h1>
        <p>Rajkot, Gujarat, India</p>
        <p>Knowledge | Innovation | Excellence</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#vision">Vision</a>
        <a href="#mission">Mission</a>
        <a href="#pso">PSOs</a>
        <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
        <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
        <a href="#recruiters">Recruiters</a>
    </nav>

    <section id="vision">
        <h2>Vision</h2>
        <p>
            To provide quality education and develop skilled,
            responsible, and innovative professionals who can
            contribute to society.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="mission">
        <h2>Mission</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Provide quality education and practical knowledge.</li>
            <li>Encourage innovation, creativity, and research.</li>
            <li>Develop professional and communication skills.</li>
            <li>Prepare students for successful careers.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="pso">
        <h2>Program Specific Outcomes (PSOs)</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                Apply computer engineering knowledge to solve
                real-world technical problems.
            </li>
            <li>
                Develop software applications using programming
                languages and modern tools.
            </li>
            <li>
                Use databases, web technologies, and software
                development techniques effectively.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="courses">
        <h2>Courses Offered</h2>

        <div class="course-container">
            <div class="course">
                <h3>B.Tech CE</h3>
                <p>Computer Engineering</p>
            </div>

            <div class="course">
                <h3>B.Tech IT</h3>
                <p>Information Technology</p>
            </div>

            <div class="course">
                <h3>B.Tech ME</h3>
                <p>Mechanical Engineering</p>
            </div>

            <div class="course">
                <h3>B.Tech EC</h3>
                <p>Electronics Engineering</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="gallery">
        <h2>Image Gallery of Events</h2>

        <div class="gallery">
            <img
                src="https://placehold.co/500x320?text=Technical+Event"
                alt="Technical event">

            <img
                src="https://placehold.co/500x320?text=Cultural+Event"
                alt="Cultural event">

            <img
                src="https://placehold.co/500x320?text=Sports+Event"
                alt="Sports event">

            <img
                src="https://placehold.co/500x320?text=Annual+Function"
                alt="Annual function">
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="recruiters">
        <h2>Top Recruiters</h2>

        <div class="recruiters">
            <div class="recruiter">TCS</div>
            <div class="recruiter">Infosys</div>
            <div class="recruiter">Wipro</div>
            <div class="recruiter">Accenture</div>
            <div class="recruiter">Capgemini</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Marwadi University</p>
        <p>College Information Website | HTML and Css</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
